<h3>2026-09-26 — Health Kitchen added to hosting account features list</h3>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>What.</strong> Added <code>healthkitchen</code> to the add-on checkboxes and save logic on <code>/membership/admin/hosting_account_edit/:id</code> so it appears in the list of features for hosted sites.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Why.</strong> Health Kitchen module and self-serve addon already existed (in Membership.pm, SiteModules, Navigation, HealthKitchen controller), but the admin hosting edit page was missing it from the hardcoded feature list.</p>
<p class="doc-body"><strong>Files.</strong> <code>Comserv/lib/Comserv/Controller/Membership/Admin.pm</code>, <code>Comserv/root/membership/admin/hosting_account_edit.tt</code></p>
</div>
